      "title": "KIM Q3 FFO Beats on Strong Leasing, Revenues Miss, 2026 Outlook Raised",
      "summary": "Kimco Realty reported Q3 2026 FFO of 47 cents per share, beating consensus estimates by 1 cent, driven by strong leasing activity with 12% blended cash rent spreads and record small-shop occupancy of 92.9%. While total revenues missed expectations at $546.15 million, the company raised its 2026 FFO guidance to $1.84-$1.86 per share and same-property NOI growth outlook to 3.5%-3.8%, reflecting healthy leasing demand and improved tenant credit performance.",
